{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cOne night, I opened my father\u2019s old diary\u2026 and found the truth he left behind.\u201d</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Echoes of the Cove</strong> is a 2D action adventure RPG about following in your father\u2019s footsteps. Track the missing pages of his diary, uncover his fate, and explore a forgotten coastal town and the mysterious lands surrounding it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.poster.avif?t=1765473560\" width=720 height=192 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.webm?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/6d61d46fa3d93b0dadd0697abd34c00d.mp4?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explore. Discover. Rebuild.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Follow the diary\u2019s clues</strong> across a hand-crafted open world filled with dungeons, puzzles, and side stories.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Battle</strong> strange creatures in real-time combat using tools, weapons, and your wits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover</strong> the mysteries of <i>The Cove</i>, from the old lighthouse to the crypt buried beneath the city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meet its last inhabitants</strong>, each with their own memories, regrets and secrets. Forge bonds that can shape your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shape your path</strong> through exploration and choices that bring you closer to your father's fate.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.poster.avif?t=1765473560\" width=720 height=264 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.webm?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/8a6e095fa824b619aa8e7d1cb1932814.mp4?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey through storms, ruins and fading echoes of the past in a coastal fantasy adventure inspired by <i>classic Zelda exploration</i> and <i>Stardew Valley style town life</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/4ea3a97fc125a05b941c076aacc930ef.poster.avif?t=1765473560\" width=720 height=476 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/4ea3a97fc125a05b941c076aacc930ef.webm?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/4ea3a97fc125a05b941c076aacc930ef.mp4?t=1765473560\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850/extras/09f15e84228baa1c66790a27da71d3d7.avif?t=1765473560\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4094850